# Original Idea

Add lifecycle hooks system (pre/post-tool, pre/post-session, etc) broadly compatible with existing coding CLIs (Claude Code hooks, Codex lifecycle events, etc). Should allow users to configure shell commands or scripts that fire at defined lifecycle points. Consider: pre_tool, post_tool, pre_session, post_session, on_error, on_compact, on_restart. Design should be extensible and align with conventions from Claude Code and Codex hook systems where applicable.

